@PaymentsModule_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@Token = <JWT from the identity provider>

### Open cash shift (201 Created / 409 CASH_SHIFT_ALREADY_OPEN)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/cash-shifts/open
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "opening_float": 500.00
}

### Real-time cash shift summary (200 OK / 404 CASH_SHIFT_NOT_OPEN)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/cash-shifts/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Charge a dining session (201 Created / 4xx ErrorResponse)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dinning_session_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-1234-56789abcdef0",
  "tip": 15.00,
  "payments": [
    { "method": "EFECTIVO", "amount": 200.00, "authorization_reference": null },
    { "method": "TARJETA_CREDITO", "amount": 300.00, "authorization_reference": "AUTH-987654" }
  ]
}

### Close cash shift (200 OK / 422 CASH_SHIFT_NOT_OPEN)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/cash-shifts/close
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "declared_cash": 2500.00,
  "reason": null
}

### Ticket detail by folio
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/TX-20260901-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Print ticket by folio
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/TX-20260901-000001/ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sales history (paged, filters are optional)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments?fecha_inicio=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&fecha_fin=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z&estado=COMPLETADO&page_index=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sales export, Administrador only ([inicio, fin), at most 31 days)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/export?inicio=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&fin=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
